data-v-49656d0b><button class="sound-toggle btn-label ttu" aria-label="Enable sounds" data-v-49656d0b><span class="sound-toggle__label-wrapper ts-b"><span class="sound-toggle__label-inner"><span class="sound-toggle__label"> SOUND </span><span aria-hidden="true" class="sound-toggle__label-status sound-toggle__label-status--off">OFF</span><span aria-hidden="false" class="sound-toggle__label-status sound-toggle__label-status--on">ON</span></span></span><svg class="sound-toggle-svg" viewBox="0 0 25 25" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle class="sound-toggle-svg-circle" cx="12.5" cy="12.5" r="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.5" fill="none"></circle><circle class="sound-toggle-svg-circle--hover" cx="12.5" cy="12.5" r="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.5" fill="none"></circle><path d="M8.5 12.500L8.77 12.500L9.03 12.500L9.30 12.500L9.57 12.500L9.83 12.500L10.10 12.500L10.37 12.500L10.63 12.500L10.90 12.500L11.17 12.500L11.43 12.500L11.70 12.500L11.97 12.500L12.23 12.500L12.50 12.500L12.77 12.500L13.03 12.500L13.30 12.500L13.57 12.500L13.83 12.500L14.10 12.500L14.37 12.500L14.63 12.500L14.90 12.500L15.17 12.500L15.43 12.500L15.70 12.500L15.97 12.500L16.23 12.500L16.50 12.500" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-miterlimit="10" fill="none"></path></svg></button></div><!--]--></div><div class="fade menu-toggle-reveal" style="--fade-duration:0.3s;--fade-delay:0s;" data-v-49656d0b data-v-3f1fbcc8><!--[--><button class="btn-link ts-b btn-link--default menu-toggle" style="--cloud-x:100%;" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-menu" data-v-49656d0b data-v-05faef33><svg class="btn-link__border" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-v-05faef33><defs data-v-05faef33><pattern id="noise-v-0" x="0" y="0" width="300" height="300" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" data-v-05faef33><image href="/textures/grain.webp" width="300" height="300" data-v-05faef33></image></pattern></defs><rect x="0.5" y="0.5" rx="3.5" ry="3.5" fill="none" stroke="url(#noise-v-0)" stroke-width="1" opacity="1" data-v-05faef33></rect></svg><svg class="btn-link__hover" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-v-05faef33><defs data-v-05faef33><pattern id="noise-hover-v-1" x="0" y="0" width="300" height="300" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" data-v-05faef33><image href="/textures/grain.webp" width="300" height="300" data-v-05faef33></image></pattern></defs><rect x="0.5" y="0.5" rx="4.25" ry="4.25" fill="none" stroke="url(#noise-hover-v-1)" stroke-width="1" opacity="1" data-v-05faef33></rect></svg><span class="btn-link__text" data-v-05faef33><span class="btn-link__text-line" data-v-05faef33>Menu</span><span class="btn-link__text-line" aria-hidden="true" data-v-05faef33>Menu</span></span><!----></button><!--]--></div></nav><!----></div><main><div class="masked-panel" data-v-a639c1ee data-v-a17c7e3a><div class="masked-panel__mask" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a17c7e3a></div><div class="masked-panel__nav-fade" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a17c7e3a></div><!--[--><div class="masked-panel__content" data-v-a17c7e3a><!--[--><div class="studio-content" data-v-a639c1ee data-v-7ecdebce><!--[--><!--[--><section class="studio-text" data-v-7ecdebce data-v-a3c2368b><div class="panel-grid" data-v-a3c2368b><div class="panel-full" data-v-a3c2368b><p class="eyebrow ts-b" data-v-a3c2368b>Studio</p><div class="studio-text__body ts-p" data-v-a3c2368b><!--[--><h2>Great audio is more than great sounds.</h2><p>Audio only feels good when the systems behind it work. We put as much care into how audio plays back as into the audio itself, and we&#39;re happy to own all of it from the first sound to the final mix.</p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--><!--[--><section class="studio-list" data-v-7ecdebce data-v-d3b6b319><div class="panel-grid" data-v-d3b6b319><p class="panel-full eyebrow ts-b label" data-v-d3b6b319>Services</p></div><!----><div class="panel-grid cells" data-v-d3b6b319><!--[--><div class="panel-half cell" data-v-d3b6b319><h2 class="cell__title" data-v-d3b6b319>Sound Design</h2><p class="cms-text cell__text ts-p" data-v-d3b6b319 data-v-11d40530>Sound can help sell a story, give clarity to design, and bring worlds to life. It&#39;s the craft we&#39;ve built our careers around, and we strive for its absolute perfection.</p></div><div class="panel-half cell" data-v-d3b6b319><h2 class="cell__title" data-v-d3b6b319>Music</h2><p class="cms-text cell__text ts-p" data-v-d3b6b319 data-v-11d40530>We write music that not only imparts a sense of quality and polish, but helps deliver the emotional impact your project requires — driving your direction or delivering on a specific artistic vision.</p></div><div class="panel-half cell" data-v-d3b6b319><h2 class="cell__title" data-v-d3b6b319>Implementation</h2><p class="cms-text cell__text ts-p" data-v-d3b6b319 data-v-11d40530>We refuse to toss assets over the fence. We own all elements of our work from start to finish, including Wwise audio system design and in-game mixing.</p></div><div class="panel-half cell" data-v-d3b6b319><h2 class="cell__title" data-v-d3b6b319>Audio Direction</h2><p class="cms-text cell__text ts-p" data-v-d3b6b319 data-v-11d40530>We think years ahead, designing audio pipelines for scalability and sustainability. Strategic leadership across the entire pipeline — from concept through ship.</p></div><!--]--></div></section><!--]--><!--[--><section class="studio-list" data-v-7ecdebce data-v-d3b6b319><div class="panel-grid" data-v-d3b6b319><p class="panel-full eyebrow ts-b label" data-v-d3b6b319>Facilities</p></div><div class="panel-grid" data-v-d3b6b319><div class="panel-full media" data-v-d3b6b319><img src="/cms/90f2321c620cdbd008c6361d3794eee6a57453a4-w1024q75.webp" srcset="/cms/90f2321c620cdbd008c6361d3794eee6a57453a4-w640q75.webp 640w, /cms/90f2321c620cdbd008c6361d3794eee6a57453a4-w1024q75.webp 1024w, /cms/90f2321c620cdbd008c6361d3794eee6a57453a4-w1600q75.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 800px" alt="Facilities" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-d3b6b319></div></div><div class="panel-grid cells" data-v-d3b6b319><!--[--><div class="panel-half cell" data-v-d3b6b319><h2 class="cell__title" data-v-d3b6b319>Experience you can hear</h2><p class="cms-text cell__text ts-p" data-v-d3b6b319 data-v-11d40530>No juniors, no training people while on your project. The people making your sound have shipped at every scale, from solo indie to AAA.</p></div><div class="panel-half cell" data-v-d3b6b319><h2 class="cell__title" data-v-d3b6b319>We finish what we start</h2><p class="cms-text cell__text ts-p" data-v-d3b6b319 data-v-11d40530>Studios have changed publishers, lost funding, and restructured mid-project. We stayed to the end of every one.</p></div><!--]--></div></section><!--]--><!--[--><div class="studio-button panel-grid" data-v-7ecdebce data-v-733fa3f6><a href="/technical-specifications" class="btn-link ts-b btn-link--default panel-half btn" style="--cloud-x:100%;" data-v-733fa3f6 data-v-05faef33><svg class="btn-link__border" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-v-05faef33><defs data-v-05faef33><pattern id="noise-v-2" x="0" y="0" width="300" height="300" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" data-v-05faef33><image href="/textures/grain.webp" width="300" height="300" data-v-05faef33></image></pattern></defs><rect x="0.5" y="0.5" rx="3.5" ry="3.5" fill="none" stroke="url(#noise-v-2)" stroke-width="1" opacity="1" data-v-05faef33></rect></svg><svg class="btn-link__hover" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-v-05faef33><defs data-v-05faef33><pattern id="noise-hover-v-3" x="0" y="0" width="300" height="300" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" data-v-05faef33><image href="/textures/grain.webp" width="300" height="300" data-v-05faef33></image></pattern></defs><rect x="0.5" y="0.5" rx="4.25" ry="4.25" fill="none" stroke="url(#noise-hover-v-3)" stroke-width="1" opacity="1" data-v-05faef33></rect></svg><span class="btn-link__text" data-v